  "description": "After Amanda's parents divorce, Amanda and her mom relocate to a new town. Amanda tries to be cooperative about the move, but her mom won't explain why they're there, or even how she heard of the strange place. As Amanda explores the town and begins to unravel the decades-old disappearances of girls around her age, she starts to fear she's in danger too. With her mom's behavior growing ever more detached and bizarre, will Amanda be able to save them both before it's too late?\n\nSource - Webtoon",
